- * trims, no CM v4.0 blocks. NULL without the luminance of the mastering display. */
+ * codes; at most 0.001 cd/m2 is 7, as dovi_tool has it), level 1, level 5 (the whole picture) and level 6 (the static
+ * metadata). CM v2.9: no trims, no CM v4.0 blocks. NULL without the luminance of the mastering display. */
