+/* The same with a level 1 block given (12-bit PQ codes) and a level 5 block of area (the offsets left, right, top,
+ * bottom, in pixels of the picture; NULL: the whole picture, all four 0): for HDR10 measured as Dolby Vision
+ * (dvbridge_measured.h). (Hades: the level 5 block is there without area too: these are Hades' own metadata, and the
